+# GT30Pro Dynarmic notes (Dimensity 8350U, ARMv9-A)
+- Dynarmic ARM64-on-ARM64 with fastmem + block linking is already ~85% native speed.
+- Keep ON: fastmem, fastmem_exclusives, block linking, unsafe_host_mmu.
+- "Direct execution without JIT" is impossible (Switch SVC/MMU layout differs from Android).
+- Do NOT raise cpu_ticks above 16000: it overheats the prime core and hits the 42C throttle sooner.
+- Emulation thread belongs on the prime A715; hard pinning needs root (best-effort via priority).
